<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"A warning from <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> at this time of year, Goto takes in all seriousness! I'll refrain from cram school today!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Unexpectedly, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> agreed without argument.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s intuition. </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3"> had better do as it says."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> put in a word as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At any rate, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> would not be going to cram school.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Well then, if you'll excuse me!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">With that, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> climbed onto her bicycle.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hold on, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3">! </STYLE>You<STYLE ID="3">, what are you doing after this? Come over to our place if you like."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考える.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"No! I'll go and gather more information! Look forward to it, please!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="2"> snapped off a salute.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, that's true... With </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="3"> collecting new information, we would have good material sooner than anywhere else!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Then, if you'll excuse me!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Goto<STYLE ID="2"> headed off toward the park.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, was that all right? Didn't you want to investigate with </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, the deal was only a little rubbernecking to start with. I'm satisfied! Sorry for dragging you along."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, my body was doing well today, so it's fine! I got to see </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">, too, and going along with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> really does mean running into something fun!"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"So, uh... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was fidgeting somehow, rubbing her index fingers together.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What is it? The restroom? Is your stomach bad again?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, no... it's not that. We've come all the way out here... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s feeling fine... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">school is out... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">and the weather isn't bad..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Seeing </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> like that, I couldn't help a small laugh.</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "30"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hee... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, where do you want to go?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">When I said that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> scratched her head, looking embarrassed.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"No, well, actually... there's a special pizza fair on by the station today, with an Italian chef... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Well... I was thinking I'd like to go..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I see, so that is why </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> recommended delivery pizza for lunch.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Going out with me is hard for her, so she had been trying to cover it up with delivery pizza.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hee hee, just what I would expect of the woman who loves pizza most in the world!</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sure, let's go!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> saying selfish things like this makes me happy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組みアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ooh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> really are my angel!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> threw her arms around me and held on tight.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, now you're exaggerating. But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you only just ate, didn't you? Weren't you full?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"No, I was thinking of getting takeout. Pizza for dinner too, maybe."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み全身.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Riiight! In that case, we sortie at once!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I fell in with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s mood as well and started pedaling.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
